{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10117220","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10117220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1011722001:0":{"text":"そういえば、バドーゾ山脈ってどんな所なんですか？","source_cn":"说起来，瓦度索山脉是什么地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12249210135FCC86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011722002:0":{"text":"あそこには、私たちと信仰を同じくするヴェルディア連盟の者が多く暮らしています。","source_cn":"那里也有许多绿裔联盟成员生活，我们拥有共同的信仰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD65BBC8DFD5CB912","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011722003:0":{"text":"ですが、より世俗離れしている彼らは、私たちと理念が少々異なっていて、たまにしか交流しません。","source_cn":"但他们与我们理念有所不同，更加出世，薄暮丛林与他们偶有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BA7B730F7692EA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011722004:0":{"text":"一刻も早く、あそこでアルドン様と、流光の樹を救う方向を見つけないと……","source_cn":"希望我们在那里能尽快找到雅顿贤者，和拯救流荧树的方法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x322B3D73F05D389F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"ライカ","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"spea